00:13:49,380 --> 00:14:03,200
above the sand. Pour the pre-absorbed silica onto the top of the sand. Use a small amount
留一薄层溶剂。把预吸附好的硅胶倒在砂层上。用少量

119
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:09,040
of the solvent mixture to rinse the flask and wash the silica down from the sides of the column.
混合溶剂冲洗烧瓶，并把柱子侧壁上的硅胶冲下去。

120
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:24,510
Drain the solvent to the top of the silica and add a small layer of sand. Carefully fill the
把溶剂放到硅胶顶部，再加入一薄层砂子。像之前一样小心地往

121
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:33,620
column with solvent as before. One alternative to dry-loading is loading your sample as a solution
柱子里加满溶剂。干法上样的一种替代办法是，把样品溶解在

122
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:38,100
in a solvent that is more polar than the solvent system you're using for your column.
比过柱所用溶剂体系极性更大的溶剂中，以溶液形式上样。

123
00:14:38,100 --> 00:14:43,380
You will end up with a thick band of compound and poor separation.
这样你最终会得到一条很宽的化合物带，分离效果很差。

124
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:49,780
Once your sample is loaded on the column, you must begin running it immediately,
一旦样品上到柱子上，就必须立即开始过柱，

125
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:53,780
and it's a good idea not to take any breaks until it's through.
而且最好在跑完之前不要休息。

126
00:14:55,620 --> 00:15:00,820
Before you start, make sure you have an adequate supply of your chosen solvent mixture
开始之前，确保你备有充足的选定混合溶剂

127
00:15:00,820 --> 00:15:06,980
and a nice big rack of test tubes. Begin running the column by placing a test
和一大架试管。开始过柱时，在柱子底部放一支

128
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:18,270
tube at the bottom of the column, applying pressure to the top, and opening the stopcock.
试管，在顶部加压，并打开活塞。

129
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:25,520
If the pressure is right, you should have a fairly rapid flow of solvent out of the bottom of the
如果压力合适，溶剂应该会以相当快的速度从柱子

130
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:35,730
column. You may have to adjust the pressure so that the flow rate isn't a slow drip or
底部流出。你可能需要调节压力，使流速既不是慢慢地一滴一滴，

131
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:52,370
an out-of-control stream, but something right in the middle. Don't forget to continually collect
也不是失控的一股激流，而是恰好介于两者之间。别忘了持续用试管

132
00:15:52,370 --> 00:16:05,950
the eluent in test tubes. You have to pay attention so that the solvent doesn't overflow.
收集洗脱液。你必须留意，别让溶剂溢出来。

133
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:26,610
Caution. Pay close attention to the solvent level and refill frequently.
注意！密切关注溶剂液面，并经常补加。

134
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:34,750
Now your hard work is over and it's time to see if it paid off.
现在你的辛苦工作结束了，该看看是否有回报了。

135
00:16:36,110 --> 00:16:40,030
When your compound is colored, it can be easy to find it in the fractions,
如果你的化合物是有颜色的，就很容易在各馏分中找到它，

136
00:16:40,830 --> 00:16:44,830
but a more reliable method for monitoring your column is with TLC.
但监测过柱更可靠的方法是用 TLC。

137
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:51,390
You can easily spot five or six fractions per TLC plate. Make sure you rinse your spotter in
每块 TLC 板上你可以轻松点五六个馏分。在点不同馏分之间，

138
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:57,390
between fractions. Develop the plates with a solvent mixture that spreads the spots out
一定要冲洗点样管。用能把斑点在板上分散开的

139
00:16:57,390 --> 00:17:02,350
on the plate. It does not have to be the same solvent system you use for the column.
混合溶剂展开。它不必与过柱所用的溶剂体系相同。

140
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:09,440
If it goes well, you will end up with a maximum of one compound per fraction,
如果顺利的话，你最终每个馏分里最多只有一种化合物，

141
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:14,080
with a few clean fractions in between the compounds you're trying to separate.
而在你要分离的各化合物之间还会有几个干净的馏分。

142
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:19,920
Unfortunately, it doesn't always work out so well.
不幸的是，事情并不总是这么顺利。

143
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:27,440
Overlapping fractions containing more than one compound are the sign of a failed separation.
含有不止一种化合物的重叠馏分，就是分离失败的标志。

144
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:35,840
So what went wrong? If all of the material elutes in just a few fractions,
那么问题出在哪里？如果所有物料都在少数几个馏分中洗脱出来，

145
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:44,000
then the column may have been too small or the developing solvent too polar. On the other hand,
那可能是柱子太小，或者展开溶剂极性太大。另一方面，

146
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:49,680
if the compounds are spread out over many fractions, then the column may have been too
如果化合物分散在许多馏分中，那可能是柱子太

147
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:59,490
tall or you used too much solvent to load your sample. Once the last compound has come off of
高，或者你上样时用了太多溶剂。一旦最后一种化合物从

148
00:17:59,490 --> 00:18:05,330
the column and you have analyzed your TLC plates, it is time to combine the desired fractions.
柱子上下来，并且你分析完 TLC 板，就该合并所需的馏分了。

149
00:18:07,330 --> 00:18:12,770
Combine all of the fractions containing the same pure compound in a round bottom flask.
把含有同一种纯化合物的所有馏分合并到一个圆底烧瓶中。

150
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:20,400
Fractions containing more than one compound should be set aside for further purification.
含有不止一种化合物的馏分应留待进一步纯化。

151
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:28,240
It is a good idea to rinse the test tubes two or three times with a little bit of clean solvent
最好用少量洁净溶剂冲洗试管两到三次，

152
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:35,570
and add those rinses to the flask as well. Don't fill the flask more than half full.
并把这些冲洗液也加入烧瓶。烧瓶装液不要超过一半。

153
00:18:35,570 --> 00:18:38,450
Remember, you need to concentrate it on the rotavap.
记住，你还需要在旋转蒸发仪上浓缩它。

154
00:18:40,210 --> 00:18:45,490
Removing solvent from your compound is the last step in a chromatographic purification.
从化合物中除去溶剂是色谱纯化的最后一步。

155
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:54,300
Never discard any fractions until you recover the desired material.
在回收到目标物料之前，绝不要丢弃任何馏分。

156
00:18:56,220 --> 00:19:01,580
It is a good idea to clean up the silica before you discard it in the appropriate waste container.
最好先把硅胶清理干净，再把它丢进合适的废物容器。

157
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:06,300
When you are sure that there is no more desired material on the column,
当你确定柱子上已经没有目标物料时，

158
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:10,940
fill the column with ethanol, place a flask underneath,
往柱子里加满乙醇，下面放一个烧瓶，

159
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:15,260
and push air through the column until the silica is dry and free flowing.
然后向柱子中压入空气，直到硅胶干燥并能自由流动。

160
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:22,700
At this point, it will be easy to discard the silica by pouring it into the proper waste container.
这时，就很容易把硅胶倒进合适的废物容器丢弃了。

161
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:28,740
When you need to purify a small amount of compound,
当你需要纯化少量化合物时，

162
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:32,420
it is sometimes easier to run a micro column in a pipette.
有时在滴管中跑一根微型柱会更容易。

163
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:39,460
On small scale, the packing and sample loading steps are greatly simplified.
在小规模下，装柱和上样步骤都大大简化了。

164
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:46,180
It is easiest to pack a micro column completely dry without any solvent.
微型柱最容易的装法是完全干装，不用任何溶剂。

165
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:50,580
Plug the end of the pipette with a small piece of cotton.
用一小块棉花塞住滴管的末端。

166
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:55,540
Then, add a couple of inches of adsorbent and a thin layer of sand.
然后加入几英寸高的吸附剂和一薄层砂子。

167
00:19:57,620 --> 00:20:02,100
Next, add your sample, pre-absorbed onto a small amount of adsorbent.
接着加入预吸附在少量吸附剂上的样品。

168
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:06,340
Top it off with a thin layer of sand and you are ready to go.
最上面再加一薄层砂子，就可以开始了。

169
00:20:09,170 --> 00:20:14,610
To run the column, place a collection flask or a test tube underneath the pipette,
过柱时，在滴管下面放一个收集烧瓶或一支试管，

170
00:20:15,410 --> 00:20:19,010
and use another pipette to add solvent to the top of the column.
用另一支滴管往柱子顶部加溶剂。

171
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:25,200
Keep adding solvent until your compound has come off of the column.
持续加入溶剂，直到你的化合物从柱子上下来。

172
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:28,160
Make sure you don't let the column run dry.
一定不要让柱子流干。

173
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:57,220
This video has outlined the basic steps that you will use to perform a purification
本视频概述了用柱色谱进行纯化的

174
00:20:57,220 --> 00:21:02,340
using column chromatography. Now it's time to get in the lab and try it for yourself.
基本步骤。现在该进实验室亲自试一试了。

175
00:21:05,730 --> 00:21:09,570
Remember, this video is intended to help you prepare for lab
记住，本视频旨在通过演示正确的实验技术，

176
00:21:09,570 --> 00:21:13,250
by providing a demonstration of the proper experimental technique.
帮助你为实验做好准备。

177
00:21:13,890 --> 00:21:19,170
It is not intended as a replacement for reading your lab manual or the supplementary material.
它并不能代替阅读你的实验手册或补充材料。

178
00:21:19,890 --> 00:21:22,290
In order to become a great experimentalist,
要成为一名优秀的实验工作者，

179
00:21:22,290 --> 00:21:25,570
it is important that you understand both theory and technique.
重要的是既要理解理论，也要掌握技术。

180
00:21:26,210 --> 00:21:28,210
Now it's your turn. Good luck!
现在轮到你了。祝你好运！
